= Entity type =

[[Has type::Text]]

The primary ontological pattern a page or knowledge object represents.

Current V2 base vocabulary:

* <code>Concept</code>
* <code>Method</code>
* <code>Protocol</code>
* <code>Implementation</code>
* <code>Project</code>
* <code>Dataset</code>
* <code>Person</code>
* <code>Organization</code>
* <code>Event</code>
* <code>Publication</code>
* <code>Location</code>
* <code>Technology</code>

The vocabulary is intentionally extensible. Specialized types should be introduced from demonstrated content/query needs rather than pre-emptively.

V2 <code>Concept</code> broadly normalizes V1 <code>Idea</code>. V1 <code>Topic</code> is no longer the default subject/navigation type; use [[Property:Domain|Domain]], Categories, and Portals for subject browsing unless a distinct Topic object is genuinely needed.

See [[BITwiki:Entity types]] and [[BITwiki:Ontology]].
